KANG THE CONQUEROR
Scott Lang.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.727
This place isn't what you think.

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:08.955
PEYTON REED
One of the most fun things about

00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:13.879
Quantumania is we are taking our
characters into this entire universe.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.615
The Quantum Realm.

00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:17.140
