00:00:48.871 --> 00:00:50.484
JONATHAN MAJORS
The epic nature of the film...

00:00:50.871 --> 00:00:53.061
...you want to experience
on the big screen.

00:00:57.427 --> 00:00:59.231
PAUL RUDD
It's so transportive

00:00:59.297 --> 00:01:00.394
and visually striking.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:04.806
EVANGELINE LILLY
This movie, it's a sweeping universe.

00:01:04.957 --> 00:01:06.692
PEYTON REED
The sheer size and scope of it was

00:01:06.742 --> 00:01:08.535
tailor made for IMAX and 3D.

00:01:09.092 --> 00:01:10.592
EVANGELINE LILLY
I feel like you can't get a big

00:01:10.643 --> 00:01:13.006
enough screen for
Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania.

